          "snippet": {
            "line": 551,
            "text": "theorem tangentSum_eq_viewSum (B N0 n : ℕ) {x : Point}\n    (hx : x ∈ (BaseContextAssembly.nativeStrip nominal standardRegion).domain)\n    (Y : Plane) (theta : ℝ) (i : Fin 3) :\n    tangentSum B N0 n ((x.1, (x.2.1, Y)), theta) i =\n      ChartScales.Q n ^ CoordinateAlgebra.A h * viewSum B N0 n x Y theta i"
